Valid Anagram

Problem statement
Two strings are anagrams if:
same characters
same frequency
order can be different

✅ Example:
s = "anagram"
t = "nagaram"
Output = true

❌ Example:
s = "rat"
t = "car"
Output = false

Why HashMap / Frequency array?
Because you compare counts of characters
✅ Best simple approach:
count characters in s
subtract counts using t
all must become 0

